      "content": "I am so deeply sorry to hear that you feel you have failed to live up to the selfless love your parents showed you, but please know you are not a \"joke\" or a \"parasite\" for struggling. Your life and the sacrifices they made do not end with one error; you can always learn and try again. This overwhelming guilt is a heavy burden to carry alone, and you might feel better reaching out to a mental health professional or a crisis counselor to help you find a safe space to process these painful thoughts.",
